OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Fevening sunshine and then dry
OL,7,Fovernight with prolonged clear periods
OL,8,Fand variable cloud amounts. Staying
OL,9,Fwarm in urban areas with generally
OL,10,Flight winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FTemperatures rising quickly
OL,13,Fduring the morning under the strong
OL,14,FAugust sunshine. Some low cloud may
OL,15,Fdevelop along the west coast at times.
OL,16,FFeeling very warm, locally hot across
OL,17,Feastern areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
