OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FTurning
OL,6,Fa fresher and cloudier from Friday
OL,7,Fwith perhaps the odd shower by
OL,8,FSaturday, and a spell of more
OL,9,Forganised rain arriving into the west
OL,10,Flate Sunday evening.
